1
00:00:10,830 --> 00:00:11,880
Officer.

2
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:14,880
If I'd insisted on staying that night,

3
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:17,070
would Jin Juan still be okay?

4
00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:22,230
She was trying to keep me out of it.

5
00:00:25,390 --> 00:00:26,510
Who did she meet?

6
00:00:27,510 --> 00:00:28,710
Did you know that person?

7
00:00:31,670 --> 00:00:34,520
No. I didn't get
a good look at his face either.

8
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:37,350
I just remember he seemed pretty thin.

9
00:00:39,350 --> 00:00:40,840
His coat was especially large

10
00:00:41,390 --> 00:00:42,670
and didn't fit him.

11
00:00:43,430 --> 00:00:45,320
He seemed to be walking pretty fast.

12
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:47,240
My mind was such a mess at the time.

13
00:00:47,240 --> 00:00:48,710
I didn't think much of it.

14
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:50,750
Think carefully again.

15
00:00:50,750 --> 00:00:51,960
What else do you remember?

16
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:54,350
Jin Juan...

17
00:00:55,750 --> 00:00:59,030
Jin Juan was wearing
a black dress that day.

18
00:01:01,390 --> 00:01:03,200
It had a white collar.

19
00:01:05,710 --> 00:01:08,400
Her shoes were white too.

20
00:01:10,940 --> 00:01:14,940
=Medical Examiner Dr. Qin: Bones of the Past=
=Episode 7=

21
00:01:15,560 --> 00:01:17,280
That's where things stand.

22
00:01:17,310 --> 00:01:20,070
Zhang Zhiqiang has no alibi,

23
00:01:20,640 --> 00:01:22,200
so we can't rule him out as a suspect.

24
00:01:22,430 --> 00:01:24,000
I've read Jin Juan's autopsy report.

25
00:01:24,710 --> 00:01:25,870
The marks on her hands

26
00:01:26,040 --> 00:01:28,120
could only have formed
if both hands were gripping

27
00:01:28,280 --> 00:01:30,280
an object
with evenly spaced vertical ridges

28
00:01:30,280 --> 00:01:31,150
on its surface.

29
00:01:31,680 --> 00:01:33,840
The pattern resembles rebar.

30
00:01:34,120 --> 00:01:36,070
We've searched her home.

31
00:01:36,350 --> 00:01:38,430
There was nothing like rebar there.

32
00:01:39,070 --> 00:01:41,000
The body always tells the truth.

33
00:01:41,590 --> 00:01:44,150
She may not have fallen
from her home at all.

34
00:01:45,040 --> 00:01:46,400
She had to change
her shoes before going out,

35
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:48,760
and the place had
to allow for a fall from a height,

36
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:50,150
while also being nearby.

37
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:53,280
Then there's only one place.

38
00:01:55,350 --> 00:01:56,580
- The rooftop of the resettlement apartments.
- The rooftop of the resettlement apartments.

39
00:02:02,950 --> 00:02:04,150
You're really good.

40
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:11,590
Do you remember

41
00:02:12,520 --> 00:02:13,870
how you used to keep telling me,

42
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:15,400
"Dad,

43
00:02:15,870 --> 00:02:17,710
I want to catch bad guys with you"?

44
00:02:19,680 --> 00:02:21,190
But you don't even know

45
00:02:21,750 --> 00:02:23,630
your dream has already come true.

46
00:02:24,910 --> 00:02:25,710
Ming.

47
00:02:25,710 --> 00:02:26,510
Shh.

48
00:02:27,150 --> 00:02:28,000
He's asleep?

49
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:30,190
Then I'll carry him upstairs.

50
00:02:31,190 --> 00:02:32,280
Just let him sleep here.

51
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:33,800
Don't disturb him, okay?

52
00:02:34,030 --> 00:02:35,960
Go upstairs and sleep.
I'll stay with him.

53
00:02:36,080 --> 00:02:37,630
Then I want to stay here too.

54
00:02:43,470 --> 00:02:45,470
I want to be with you both.

55
00:02:46,460 --> 00:02:48,110
What are you joining in for?

56
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:00,960
Liu, gloves.

57
00:03:01,470 --> 00:03:03,710
Can you all show
some initiative at the scene?

58
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:05,750
Just because the captain isn't here,
don't leave everything to me.

59
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:07,840
I've got so much to deal with every day.

60
00:03:07,910 --> 00:03:10,030
Can you all focus on
doing some actual work?

61
00:03:10,030 --> 00:03:11,280
Show some initiative.

62
00:03:11,710 --> 00:03:13,280
You can't rely on me
to watch the scene every day.

63
00:03:13,430 --> 00:03:14,190
Hurry up.

64
00:03:14,190 --> 00:03:15,190
Captain Wang, thanks for your hard work.

65
00:03:18,190 --> 00:03:19,000
Captain Qin.

66
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:20,800
Well...

67
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:21,800
Liu.

68
00:03:22,190 --> 00:03:23,910
Could you tell me
when the captain arrives?

69
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:25,310
Captain.

70
00:03:25,310 --> 00:03:27,520
A lot of the evidence at the scene
was washed away by the rain.

71
00:03:27,520 --> 00:03:29,000
Only a small amount of blood remains.

72
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:30,870
But there's simply nothing left that can

73
00:03:30,870 --> 00:03:31,960
be collected and tested as evidence.

74
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:33,150
There are three-dimensional
footprints here

75
00:03:33,150 --> 00:03:34,360
left in the tar
after it softened in the heat.

76
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:35,430
This is directly
above Jin Juan's apartment.

77
00:03:35,870 --> 00:03:39,000
The victim may have
fallen from this spot.

78
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:39,840
Look here.

79
00:03:40,030 --> 00:03:42,080
I realized that when we were
in the autopsy room that day,

80
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:43,240
Zhou said

81
00:03:43,430 --> 00:03:45,630
the marks on the victim's
hands came from rebar.

82
00:03:45,630 --> 00:03:47,080
We may have been wrong.

83
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:49,310
The marks on her hands
may not have come from rebar.

84
00:03:49,750 --> 00:03:52,280
They may have been caused
by the wire on this railing.

85
00:03:53,710 --> 00:03:55,080
I'll reenact what the victim did.

86
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:55,910
Take a look.

87
00:03:56,470 --> 00:03:57,280
Wait.

88
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:59,470
If this is the crime scene,

89
00:04:00,590 --> 00:04:02,590
even the rain shouldn't
be allowed to disturb it.

90
00:04:02,750 --> 00:04:03,630
Leave it for the trace evidence team.

91
00:04:04,520 --> 00:04:05,360
Let's use another spot.

92
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:07,910
Here, Captain.

93
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:09,680
I'm the victim.

94
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:12,710
Look, I'm holding onto this railing.

95
00:04:12,710 --> 00:04:13,430
I need to...

96
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:15,240
No, it should be like this.

97
00:04:15,240 --> 00:04:17,870
Look, I'll reconstruct what happened.

98
00:04:18,040 --> 00:04:19,000
I'm the victim now.

99
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:19,830
I'm terrified.

100
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:20,950
I'm panicking.

101
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,270
I don't know what to do.

102
00:04:28,630 --> 00:04:29,430
Captain.

103
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:30,360
Gloves!

104
00:04:30,360 --> 00:04:31,190
Quick!

105
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:33,800
A... A clue.

106
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:38,480
I found something.

107
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:41,120
Pull me up.

108
00:04:44,600 --> 00:04:45,390
A lighter.

109
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:48,720
Zippo.

110
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:50,950
It's imported.

111
00:04:55,870 --> 00:04:57,190
Li, check again.

112
00:04:57,390 --> 00:04:58,270
See if this lighter

113
00:04:58,270 --> 00:04:59,480
has the character
"Liang" engraved on it.

114
00:05:03,940 --> 00:05:04,540
(Liang)

115
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:05,360
Yes.

116
00:05:05,510 --> 00:05:06,310
Captain.

117
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:09,160
Could the owner of this lighter,
someone named Liang,

118
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:11,040
be the killer in this case?

119
00:05:13,270 --> 00:05:14,160
Not necessarily.

120
00:05:14,270 --> 00:05:17,480
Maybe someone came up
to the rooftop for a smoke

121
00:05:18,070 --> 00:05:19,430
and accidentally left it behind.

122
00:05:19,510 --> 00:05:23,040
Most of the evidence at the scene

123
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:26,720
and all the useful traces
have been washed away.

124
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:29,510
The marks on Jin Juan's palms,

125
00:05:29,630 --> 00:05:31,750
along with this lighter,

126
00:05:31,750 --> 00:05:32,950
may be the clues we need.

127
00:05:32,950 --> 00:05:33,680
Here's what we'll do.

128
00:05:33,950 --> 00:05:36,360
Let's go through Jin Juan's
social connections again

129
00:05:36,360 --> 00:05:38,190
and see if there's anyone
named Liang around her.

130
00:05:39,560 --> 00:05:40,430
Find him first.

131
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:41,510
Understood.

132
00:05:41,750 --> 00:05:42,430
Let's go.

133
00:05:42,430 --> 00:05:43,870
Liu, evidence bag.

134
00:05:48,270 --> 00:05:49,070
Captain Qin.

135
00:05:49,360 --> 00:05:51,240
There is indeed someone
named Liang in Jin Juan's circle.

136
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:53,430
He's the Deputy General Manager
of Longfan Urban Construction Group,

137
00:05:53,430 --> 00:05:54,160
Liang Chao.

138
00:05:54,510 --> 00:05:56,360
He and Huo Qicheng
had been close for years.

139
00:05:56,920 --> 00:05:58,360
The two of them

140
00:05:58,360 --> 00:05:59,390
built Longfan Urban Construction Group
from the ground up.

141
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:01,510
Liang Chao.

142
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:05,510
I've heard that name quite often

143
00:06:05,510 --> 00:06:07,070
from people demanding money
from the urban construction company.

144
00:06:07,190 --> 00:06:09,270
What people are calling fraud

145
00:06:09,630 --> 00:06:11,120
was actually illegal fundraising.

146
00:06:11,830 --> 00:06:14,560
Liang Chao handled most of it himself.

147
00:06:15,120 --> 00:06:16,720
Huo Qicheng stayed behind the scenes.

148
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:18,360
After the construction
project collapsed,

149
00:06:18,630 --> 00:06:19,720
he wanted to shift all the blame

150
00:06:19,720 --> 00:06:20,830
onto Liang Chao.

151
00:06:22,310 --> 00:06:23,630
Our colleagues in the Economic Crime
Investigation Unit said

152
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:26,070
that of the more than 10 million yuan
they defrauded,

153
00:06:26,390 --> 00:06:27,800
Huo Qicheng took the lion's share.

154
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:30,000
Liang Chao only got a small fraction.

155
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:31,920
He must have resented that.

156
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:38,270
As Huo Qicheng's wife,

157
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:40,750
Jin Juan must have known
some of the inside story.

158
00:06:42,160 --> 00:06:46,040
She may even have had
important evidence in her possession.

159
00:06:46,270 --> 00:06:48,630
So Liang Chao would have gone
to her for one of two reasons.

160
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:49,600
First,

161
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:51,680
to find the evidence and clear his name.

162
00:06:52,310 --> 00:06:53,120
Second,

163
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:55,070
to silence her for good.

164
00:06:55,750 --> 00:06:56,430
Right.

165
00:06:56,430 --> 00:06:58,240
We've verified that lighter.

166
00:06:58,240 --> 00:06:59,360
It does belong to Liang Chao.

167
00:06:59,750 --> 00:07:01,510
We spoke to employees
at Urban Construction Company.

168
00:07:01,510 --> 00:07:04,630
They all said they'd seen
Liang Chao showing it off.

169
00:07:04,630 --> 00:07:05,950
He said it was a gift from Huo Qicheng.

170
00:07:06,310 --> 00:07:07,480
He said it was filled with

171
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:09,000
imported original-brand lighter fluid.

172
00:07:11,750 --> 00:07:13,310
A lighter alone doesn't prove

173
00:07:13,310 --> 00:07:14,720
that Liang Chao is the killer.

174
00:07:15,310 --> 00:07:18,720
Our top priority now
is to get a search warrant

175
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:19,560
and see if we can find

176
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:21,160
any other clues at his home.

177
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:22,240
Most importantly,

178
00:07:22,390 --> 00:07:25,040
we need to find shoes
that match his walking pattern.

179
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:26,390
If we can find those shoes,

180
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:28,600
we can prove he was present

181
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:31,040
where Jin Juan fell
and where her body was buried.

182
00:07:33,310 --> 00:07:34,270
The property manager just told me

183
00:07:34,270 --> 00:07:35,430
Liang Chao owns this place,

184
00:07:35,430 --> 00:07:36,680
but he hasn't been back in a long time.

185
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:37,390
How long?

186
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:38,600
Over a month.

187
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:52,270
Captain Qin.

188
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:53,800
Here's the latest.

189
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:55,160
He may have fled.

190
00:07:55,190 --> 00:07:57,430
You think I don't
already know he's gone?

191
00:07:58,040 --> 00:07:58,830
Ma,

192
00:07:59,480 --> 00:08:00,870
don't bother reporting
stale news like this

193
00:08:00,870 --> 00:08:02,190
to me again.

194
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:06,510
Come here.

195
00:08:08,120 --> 00:08:08,920
Look.

196
00:08:12,750 --> 00:08:14,040
The way a person walks

197
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:15,480
becomes ingrained in them.

198
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:17,720
Just look at these shoes.

199
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:19,120
Although they're of different ages,

200
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:21,270
the areas and degree of wear

201
00:08:21,270 --> 00:08:22,040
are all consistent.

202
00:08:22,040 --> 00:08:23,480
Especially the outer heels

203
00:08:23,510 --> 00:08:25,070
and the balls beneath the big toes.

204
00:08:25,070 --> 00:08:26,510
Those areas show the most wear.

205
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:34,630
That makes sense, Captain Qin.

206
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:36,480
The pressure points on this model,

207
00:08:36,670 --> 00:08:39,270
including the outer heel
and forefoot pressure distribution,

208
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:40,870
almost perfectly match

209
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:43,320
the wear pattern
on Liang Chao's old shoes.

210
00:08:43,320 --> 00:08:45,240
That's his gait pattern.

211
00:08:52,270 --> 00:08:53,080
Captain Qin.

212
00:08:53,550 --> 00:08:54,390
We found this.

213
00:08:58,320 --> 00:08:59,150
Imported.

214
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:11,840
The lighter belongs to him.

215
00:09:12,030 --> 00:09:13,390
That's basically been confirmed.

216
00:09:13,910 --> 00:09:15,550
If the footprints
at the scene are his too,

217
00:09:15,550 --> 00:09:16,150
don't you think

218
00:09:16,150 --> 00:09:18,270
the chain of evidence
is almost too complete?

219
00:09:20,390 --> 00:09:22,960
Captain, what makes you say that?

220
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:24,720
What do you mean,
what makes me say that?

221
00:09:25,670 --> 00:09:26,510
Think about it.

222
00:09:28,030 --> 00:09:29,320
Someone that calculating,

223
00:09:29,870 --> 00:09:31,200
who's desperate to avoid his debts,

224
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:33,840
how could he leave behind an expensive

225
00:09:33,840 --> 00:09:35,550
lighter engraved with his own name

226
00:09:35,550 --> 00:09:36,480
at the scene?

227
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:37,270
Would you?

228
00:09:37,270 --> 00:09:38,080
Would you?

229
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:39,840
Captain Qin, I... I don't smoke.

230
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:41,200
I don't smoke.

231
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:42,720
If I had an imported lighter like this,

232
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:44,000
I'd carry it around too.

233
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:45,480
I'd show it off whenever I met someone.

234
00:09:45,600 --> 00:09:47,150
I'd take it out and show everyone.

235
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:48,910
All right, enough.

236
00:09:48,910 --> 00:09:49,840
Go investigate.

237
00:09:49,960 --> 00:09:50,750
Ma.

238
00:09:51,030 --> 00:09:52,390
Go look into it carefully.

239
00:09:52,840 --> 00:09:54,790
Report back immediately
if you find anything.

240
00:09:58,630 --> 00:09:59,440
Good grief.

241
00:10:00,150 --> 00:10:01,510
What are you standing here for?

242
00:10:03,480 --> 00:10:05,600
Ma, let me help you. Come on.

243
00:10:06,910 --> 00:10:08,840
How much do you know about your

244
00:10:08,840 --> 00:10:10,150
company's Deputy General Manager,
Liang Chao?

245
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:12,150
A little.

246
00:10:12,960 --> 00:10:14,960
What was his relationship
with Mr. Huo and Jin Juan

247
00:10:14,960 --> 00:10:15,910
like?

248
00:10:18,910 --> 00:10:19,870
Mr. Liang?

249
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:22,840
He was really devoted to Mr. Huo.

250
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:24,360
Always at his beck and call.

251
00:10:24,480 --> 00:10:26,600
He was especially afraid
Mr. Huo wouldn't think highly of him.

252
00:10:27,630 --> 00:10:28,550
And

253
00:10:29,030 --> 00:10:31,550
he was pretty attentive to Mrs. Huo too.

254
00:10:31,910 --> 00:10:33,550
He'd give her little gifts
from time to time,

255
00:10:34,030 --> 00:10:35,600
necklaces, scarves.

256
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:38,240
Mrs. Huo wouldn't even
give him the time of day,

257
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:39,390
but he never got tired of it.

258
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:41,550
One time,

259
00:10:41,870 --> 00:10:43,590
I saw...

260
00:10:58,240 --> 00:10:59,030
Juan.

261
00:10:59,440 --> 00:11:00,200
Where's Qicheng?

262
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:02,200
Don't wait. He won't see you today.

263
00:11:04,480 --> 00:11:06,030
I've done everything
Qicheng asked me to do, but I...

264
00:11:06,240 --> 00:11:07,080
I haven't reported back to him yet.

265
00:11:07,080 --> 00:11:08,360
Juan.

266
00:11:08,750 --> 00:11:10,200
Juan, could you put in a word for me?

267
00:11:10,720 --> 00:11:11,720
What did you just call me?

268
00:11:21,270 --> 00:11:22,080
Liang Chao.

269
00:11:23,750 --> 00:11:25,390
You have no right to call me that.

270
00:11:25,720 --> 00:11:26,910
I'm sorry.

271
00:11:27,440 --> 00:11:28,240
Well...

272
00:11:29,960 --> 00:11:30,750
Ms. Jin.

273
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:33,270
I've done every kind
of job over the years.

274
00:11:34,150 --> 00:11:37,030
The dirty work, the hard work,
the exhausting work.

275
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:42,600
I've even done things
that had to be kept hidden.

276
00:11:43,320 --> 00:11:44,270
All I ever hoped was that one day

277
00:11:44,270 --> 00:11:46,360
I might be worthy
of standing before you.

278
00:11:46,360 --> 00:11:47,630
That I might be worthy...

279
00:11:50,510 --> 00:11:51,320
Are you finished?

280
00:11:54,120 --> 00:11:55,120
Do you know

281
00:11:55,120 --> 00:11:56,150
when I first saw you?

282
00:11:57,510 --> 00:11:59,750
It was at your wedding to Huo Qicheng.

283
00:12:00,150 --> 00:12:03,630
You were wearing a red qipao.

284
00:12:05,270 --> 00:12:07,240
You looked so beautiful

285
00:12:07,240 --> 00:12:08,240
raising your glass for a toast.

286
00:12:08,870 --> 00:12:09,550
From that day on,

287
00:12:09,550 --> 00:12:11,960
there was no room
in my heart for anyone else.

288
00:12:12,510 --> 00:12:14,240
Juan, could you...

289
00:12:14,240 --> 00:12:15,150
Could I what?

290
00:12:16,910 --> 00:12:18,120
Do you want to replace him,

291
00:12:20,670 --> 00:12:22,870
or do you want to have me?

292
00:12:25,320 --> 00:12:26,120
Liang Chao.

293
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:28,670
In my eyes, you're nothing
but an errand boy.

294
00:12:29,670 --> 00:12:30,910
You were then, you are now,

295
00:12:30,910 --> 00:12:31,910
and you always will be.

296
00:12:34,750 --> 00:12:36,120
Do you know the difference

297
00:12:36,120 --> 00:12:37,000
between you and Huo Qicheng?

298
00:12:37,240 --> 00:12:38,630
At least Huo Qicheng knows

299
00:12:38,630 --> 00:12:40,200
he's no good.

300
00:12:41,440 --> 00:12:42,240
But you?

301
00:12:43,550 --> 00:12:45,600
You don't even realize
you're nothing but a lapdog.

302
00:12:47,840 --> 00:12:49,270
I get it.

303
00:12:50,790 --> 00:12:53,440
You're still thinking
about that lousy handyman,

304
00:12:53,790 --> 00:12:54,750
Zhang Zhiqiang, right?

305
00:12:59,480 --> 00:13:01,000
Don't you dare talk about him like that.

306
00:13:01,360 --> 00:13:02,270
I'm telling you,

307
00:13:02,910 --> 00:13:04,270
Zhang Zhiqiang is a decent,
honorable man.

308
00:13:04,270 --> 00:13:05,240
He respects me.

309
00:13:06,030 --> 00:13:06,840
What about you?

310
00:13:07,320 --> 00:13:08,120
What can you do?

311
00:13:09,320 --> 00:13:10,960
Besides flattering people and scheming,

312
00:13:10,960 --> 00:13:12,030
what else can you do?

313
00:13:12,550 --> 00:13:14,030
I...

314
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:16,200
I scheme?

315
00:13:16,390 --> 00:13:17,200
I...

316
00:13:18,670 --> 00:13:20,150
My feelings for you
are genuine, Juan. I...

317
00:13:20,150 --> 00:13:20,960
Genuine?

318
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:22,750
What are your feelings worth?

319
00:13:24,200 --> 00:13:26,000
Stop wasting your time on me.

320
00:13:26,960 --> 00:13:27,750
Juan.

321
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:28,670
I...

322
00:13:29,080 --> 00:13:31,750
By the way, that necklace you gave me,

323
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:32,870
I threw it away.

324
00:13:33,150 --> 00:13:34,870
Don't buy me anything again.

325
00:13:35,510 --> 00:13:36,390
Save your money.

326
00:13:36,510 --> 00:13:38,790
If Mr. Huo ever decides
he doesn't need you anymore,

327
00:13:39,030 --> 00:13:40,840
at least you'll have something
to fall back on.

328
00:14:06,150 --> 00:14:08,320
Later, the Group ran into trouble.

329
00:14:08,600 --> 00:14:10,480
Most of the employees were laid off,

330
00:14:11,360 --> 00:14:13,550
and their wages weren't fully paid.

331
00:14:13,630 --> 00:14:14,510
As for Mr. Huo,

332
00:14:14,960 --> 00:14:17,200
no one even knew where he was hiding.

333
00:14:17,600 --> 00:14:20,150
Ms. Jin was hardly
at the company either.

334
00:14:20,480 --> 00:14:22,150
She was forced to step in
and deal with the fallout.

335
00:14:22,550 --> 00:14:24,320
After that,

336
00:14:24,320 --> 00:14:27,390
Liang Chao's attitude toward Ms. Jin

337
00:14:27,840 --> 00:14:29,200
became even more complicated.

338
00:14:33,030 --> 00:14:33,840
Get out.

339
00:14:37,750 --> 00:14:39,790
It's late.
I just wanted to come see you.

340
00:14:42,910 --> 00:14:43,750
Say what you came to say.

341
00:14:45,720 --> 00:14:47,080
Now that Huo Qicheng has run off,

342
00:14:47,910 --> 00:14:49,150
it's just the two of us.

343
00:14:51,600 --> 00:14:52,390
Us?

344
00:14:55,550 --> 00:14:57,270
I'd do anything for you.

345
00:14:58,440 --> 00:14:59,790
I want you to have feelings for me.

346
00:15:02,200 --> 00:15:03,600
The fundraising scheme has collapsed.

347
00:15:05,270 --> 00:15:07,200
Do you know how many people
out there want you dead?

348
00:15:08,960 --> 00:15:09,840
I'm not afraid.

349
00:15:11,720 --> 00:15:13,510
The money you have
came from elderly people's

350
00:15:13,510 --> 00:15:14,360
life savings.

351
00:15:15,080 --> 00:15:17,200
Some of it came at the cost
of another man's wife taking her own life.

352
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:18,390
Didn't you marry Huo Qicheng

353
00:15:18,390 --> 00:15:19,790
for his money too?

354
00:15:19,870 --> 00:15:20,840
I have plenty of money now.

355
00:15:20,840 --> 00:15:22,550
No. I married Huo Qicheng

356
00:15:22,550 --> 00:15:23,630
because everyone in my family

357
00:15:23,630 --> 00:15:25,440
wanted to sell me
for the highest price they could get.

358
00:15:27,790 --> 00:15:29,320
Because the man I loved had no money.

359
00:15:29,320 --> 00:15:30,120
Do you understand?

360
00:15:30,150 --> 00:15:30,960
No, I don't.

361
00:15:32,510 --> 00:15:33,480
I don't understand what it is about me

362
00:15:33,480 --> 00:15:34,840
that makes me inferior
to that lousy carpenter.

363
00:15:35,320 --> 00:15:36,120
You're rotten.

364
00:15:37,750 --> 00:15:38,630
Other than doing

365
00:15:38,630 --> 00:15:39,910
those terrible things for Huo Qicheng,

366
00:15:39,910 --> 00:15:41,030
what else can you do?

367
00:15:41,840 --> 00:15:42,630
Jin Juan.

368
00:15:44,390 --> 00:15:45,840
My feelings for you are genuine.

369
00:15:46,510 --> 00:15:47,600
Genuine?

370
00:15:49,150 --> 00:15:49,910
Your feelings

371
00:15:49,910 --> 00:15:52,240
are worth as much
as those people's life savings.

372
00:15:53,390 --> 00:15:54,240
Nothing.

373
00:15:58,550 --> 00:15:59,360
Jin Juan.

374
00:16:07,390 --> 00:16:08,200
You think

375
00:16:09,120 --> 00:16:10,790
you can run off and live happily
ever after with Zhang Zhiqiang?

376
00:16:11,480 --> 00:16:13,030
You think he's safe, don't you?

377
00:16:13,840 --> 00:16:15,510
Aren't you afraid I'll tell everyone
what you've done?

378
00:16:15,510 --> 00:16:16,360
I'm not afraid.

379
00:16:21,720 --> 00:16:23,320
You think these are enough to hurt me?

380
00:16:24,480 --> 00:16:26,270
What do you think
will happen if I turn over

381
00:16:26,270 --> 00:16:27,550
all this evidence
with your signature on it?

382
00:16:29,120 --> 00:16:31,510
Believe me, you'll meet
an even worse end than Huo Qicheng.

383
00:16:37,360 --> 00:16:38,150
Get out.

384
00:16:41,360 --> 00:16:42,150
Get out.

385
00:16:50,670 --> 00:16:52,030
After something happened to Jin Juan,

386
00:16:52,240 --> 00:16:53,480
was there anyone suspicious?

387
00:16:54,440 --> 00:16:55,711
(Zhang Tiantian, Zhang Zhiqiang's Younger Sister)
Liang Chao, the Deputy General Manager

388
00:16:55,711 --> 00:16:56,860
(Zhang Tiantian, Zhang Zhiqiang's Younger Sister)
of the urban construction company.

389
00:16:56,870 --> 00:16:57,720
What makes you suspect him?

390
00:16:58,360 --> 00:16:59,600
My sister-in-law told me.

391
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:02,000
That Liang Chao
followed her around like a fly.

392
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:03,000
She couldn't get rid of him.

393
00:17:05,790 --> 00:17:06,880
Tell me about your sister-in-law.

394
00:17:09,830 --> 00:17:11,160
My sister-in-law

395
00:17:11,480 --> 00:17:13,110
seemed bold and carefree,

396
00:17:13,350 --> 00:17:15,400
but deep down,
she suffered more than anyone.

397
00:17:15,960 --> 00:17:17,400
After she got back
together with my brother,

398
00:17:17,750 --> 00:17:18,920
she and I became pretty close.

399
00:17:19,110 --> 00:17:20,400
She told me a lot of things.

400
00:17:20,880 --> 00:17:21,680
What things?

401
00:17:21,790 --> 00:17:24,070
She felt she was tainted
and didn't deserve my brother.

402
00:17:24,110 --> 00:17:25,750
So she deliberately
said some hurtful things.

403
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:26,830
Like...

404
00:17:27,440 --> 00:17:28,480
I just can't stand that you're poor.

405
00:17:28,480 --> 00:17:29,640
I want to marry someone rich.

406
00:17:29,830 --> 00:17:30,640
But actually,

407
00:17:30,790 --> 00:17:32,200
she was just afraid of dragging
my brother into her troubles.

408
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:33,880
I didn't realize until later

409
00:17:33,880 --> 00:17:35,070
that my sister-in-law

410
00:17:35,070 --> 00:17:36,070
might have seemed headstrong,

411
00:17:36,240 --> 00:17:37,790
but deep down, she was
more decent than anyone.

412
00:17:38,240 --> 00:17:40,000
My brother
was the only man she ever loved.

413
00:17:40,310 --> 00:17:41,240
He was in the past,

414
00:17:41,720 --> 00:17:42,640
he is now,

415
00:17:42,920 --> 00:17:43,880
and he always will be.

416
00:17:45,400 --> 00:17:46,550
Does your brother know?

417
00:17:46,680 --> 00:17:47,790
He didn't know before.

418
00:17:48,070 --> 00:17:50,400
But I think it's time he did.

419
00:17:52,200 --> 00:17:53,000
Captain Qin.

420
00:17:53,350 --> 00:17:54,640
Right now, all the evidence

421
00:17:54,640 --> 00:17:55,880
points to Liang Chao.

422
00:17:55,920 --> 00:17:57,350
And based on my analysis,

423
00:17:57,790 --> 00:17:59,640
Liang Chao must have started planning

424
00:17:59,640 --> 00:18:00,830
and carrying out both murders more than

425
00:18:00,830 --> 00:18:02,350
a month before they happened.

426
00:18:07,960 --> 00:18:08,750
Juan.

427
00:18:10,110 --> 00:18:11,200
You never thought

428
00:18:12,240 --> 00:18:13,480
this day would come, did you?

429
00:18:13,720 --> 00:18:16,720
Liang Chao, you think I'm afraid to die?

430
00:18:17,110 --> 00:18:19,070
I wanted to die when I was 16.

431
00:18:19,830 --> 00:18:21,750
I wanted to die
when I married Huo Qicheng.

432
00:18:22,550 --> 00:18:23,920
When I was forced
to terminate my pregnancy,

433
00:18:23,920 --> 00:18:25,070
I wanted to die then too.

434
00:18:25,640 --> 00:18:26,550
If you wanted to die so badly,

435
00:18:26,550 --> 00:18:28,510
why have you stayed alive all this time?

436
00:18:31,440 --> 00:18:34,640
I'm alive
because Zhang Zhiqiang is still here.

437
00:18:35,270 --> 00:18:37,200
As long as he's here, I can't die.

438
00:18:37,350 --> 00:18:38,830
You're still bringing him up to me?

439
00:18:38,880 --> 00:18:40,350
You think I don't dare kill you?

440
00:18:41,400 --> 00:18:42,350
Then kill me.

441
00:18:43,160 --> 00:18:44,070
I'm telling you,

442
00:18:44,160 --> 00:18:45,160
if you kill me,

443
00:18:45,510 --> 00:18:47,440
you'll live under my shadow
for the rest of your life.

444
00:18:49,480 --> 00:18:51,510
Every night when you close your eyes,

445
00:18:52,110 --> 00:18:53,750
you'll see my eyes.

446
00:18:54,030 --> 00:18:55,480
Juan, I'm begging you.

447
00:18:55,880 --> 00:18:57,110
Just give in to me, okay?

448
00:18:57,920 --> 00:18:58,720
Beg me.

449
00:18:58,720 --> 00:19:00,160
Beg me and I'll pull you up, Juan.

450
00:19:00,920 --> 00:19:01,830
Beg me.

451
00:19:02,680 --> 00:19:03,920
Beg me!

452
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:06,440
Juan, please beg me!

453
00:19:37,410 --> 00:19:41,930
♪The old walkie-talkie I treasure♪

454
00:19:45,000 --> 00:19:49,780
♪The birthday surprise
you gave me that year♪

455
00:19:52,490 --> 00:19:57,870
♪Its buttons worn
and weathered with time♪

456
00:19:58,400 --> 00:20:03,730
♪Still echoing your words,
"Be brave and keep moving on"♪

457
00:20:05,760 --> 00:20:13,720
♪The old train rolled over
our reluctance to part♪

458
00:20:14,350 --> 00:20:19,400
♪You waved goodbye
and faded into the night♪

459
00:20:21,440 --> 00:20:29,750
♪I used to think
we'd always have more time♪

460
00:20:29,750 --> 00:20:35,600
♪But that goodbye became the last♪

461
00:20:37,060 --> 00:20:45,180
♪I carry the warmth you left behind♪

462
00:20:45,870 --> 00:20:50,910
♪Making my way
through every door in life♪

463
00:20:52,690 --> 00:21:00,730
♪Whenever a train
whistle sounds at night♪

464
00:21:01,010 --> 00:21:08,280
♪I suddenly long to call out to you♪

465
00:21:08,480 --> 00:21:12,890
♪Can you hear me?♪

466
00:21:12,900 --> 00:21:16,690
♪Can you hear me?♪

467
00:21:16,690 --> 00:21:24,150
♪Let the old receiver
carry the words I never said♪

468
00:21:24,150 --> 00:21:31,890
♪I've taken on
both your duty and your love♪

469
00:21:32,220 --> 00:21:37,830
♪This train has no return, and when I
look back, you're no longer waiting♪

470
00:21:39,710 --> 00:21:43,310
♪After all these years♪

471
00:21:45,820 --> 00:21:53,300
♪How I wish I could
talk to you just one more time♪

472
00:21:54,200 --> 00:21:55,500
♪And tell you♪

473
00:21:56,720 --> 00:21:59,990
♪I haven't let you down♪
